;font-size:28px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-0.02em;color:#0f1716;\">Tu solicitud está en proceso</h1>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-family:'Switzer','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;color:#495251;\">Hola <strong style=\"font-weight:600;color:#0f1716;\">{{ String(($('Datos correo oferta').item.json.nombre) ?? '').trim().replace(/[&<>\"']/g, c => '&#' + c.charCodeAt(0) + ';') }}</strong>, tu pago se procesó con éxito. Estamos buscando la mejor oferta para tu auto en la red de vendedores oficiales y te contactaremos a la brevedad.</p>\n\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:8px 0 24px;background:#caefea;border-radius:12px;\">\n  <tr><td style=\"padding:20px;\">\n    <p style=\"margin:0;font-family:'Switzer','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.4;color:#0f1716;\">Auto que buscas</p>\n    <p style=\"margin:4px 0 0;font-family:'Switzer','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:20px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.01em;color:#0f1716;\">{{ String(($('Datos correo oferta').item.json.auto) ?? '').trim().replace(/[&<>\"']/g, c => '&#' + c.charCodeAt(0) + ';') || 'Sin indicar' }}</p>\n  </td></tr>\n</table>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 12px;font-family:'Switzer','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-0.01em;color:#0f1716;\">Qué pasa ahora</p>\n\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:8px 0 24px;border-top:1px solid #dfe4e4;\">\n  <tr>\n    <td style=\"padding:12px 16px 12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #dfe4e4;font-family:'Switzer','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.4;color:#495251;vertical-align:top;width:8%;\">1</td>\n    <td style=\"padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #dfe4e4;font-family:'Switzer','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,san